OL,3,GNEWSACharity unveils education centre
OL,4,Aon 10th birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Brighton charity which has supported
OL,7,Fyoung people with learning disabilities
OL,8,Fand autism into employment for a decade
OL,9,Fis unveiling a new education centre on
OL,10,Fits milestone birthday.
OL,12,FTeam Domenica was founded in 2016 by
OL,13,FBaroness Rosa Monckton, who created the
OL,14,Fcharity in honour of her daughter,
OL,15,FDomenica, who has Down's syndrome.
OL,17,FThe new facility is above the North
OL,18,FStar pub in the city centre, which has
OL,19,Fbeen operating as a hospitality
OL,20,Ftraining venue since being opened by
OL,21,Fpatron Nigella Lawson late last year.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
